sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Server as rest-proxy<br/>8008/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant Marshaler as Custom JSON Marshaler<br/>(in-process)
    participant GRPCClient as gRPC Client<br/>(in-process)
    participant ModelMesh as ModelMesh gRPC Service<br/>8033/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,ModelMesh: Flow 1: REST Inference Request

    Client->>Server: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>Optional TLS
    Server->>Marshaler: Decode JSON request body<br/>Tensor data (flat/nested arrays, base64 BYTES)
    Marshaler->>Marshaler: Unmarshal tensor data<br/>Handle BOOL, INT8-64, UINT8-64,<br/>FP16, FP32, FP64, BYTES types
    Marshaler->>GRPCClient: Protobuf ModelInferRequest
    GRPCClient->>ModelMesh: gRPC ModelInfer()<br/>localhost:8033<br/>Optional TLS
    ModelMesh-->>GRPCClient: gRPC ModelInferResponse
    GRPCClient-->>Marshaler: Protobuf ModelInferResponse
    Marshaler-->>Marshaler: Convert raw binary outputs<br/>to typed JSON arrays
    Marshaler-->>Server: JSON response body
    Server-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK<br/>application/json

    Note over Client,ModelMesh: Flow 2: Model Metadata Request

    Client->>Server: GET /v2/models/{name}<br/>Optional TLS
    Server->>GRPCClient: Forward as gRPC call
    GRPCClient->>ModelMesh: gRPC ModelMetadata()<br/>localhost:8033<br/>Optional TLS
    ModelMesh-->>GRPCClient: gRPC ModelMetadataResponse
    GRPCClient-->>Server: Protobuf response
    Server-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK<br/>JSON metadata
